---
title: "Zoom on the API: each layer, left to right"
---
flowchart LR
  L1["<b>1. api/</b><br/><i>speaks HTTP</i><br/><br/>routes: validate, call a service<br/>schemas: request and response shapes<br/>errors: one error format"]
  L2["<b>2. services/</b><br/><i>runs the use cases</i><br/><br/>BookingService: book, get<br/>TripService: search, dashboard, status<br/>lock_trip: locks the trip<br/>while booking"]
  L3["<b>3. domain/</b><br/><i>holds the business rules</i><br/><br/>pricing: zone fares<br/>booking rules: on sale, not left, seats left<br/>lifecycle: Scheduled, Boarding,<br/>Departed, In transit,<br/>Arrived, Completed<br/>events: sent after each save<br/>(in process, no outbox)<br/>models: tables and checks"]
  L4["<b>4. infra/</b><br/><i>plumbing</i><br/><br/>db: sessions, timeouts<br/>logs: JSON with request id"]
  PG[("PostgreSQL")]

  L1 -->|calls| L2
  L2 -->|uses| L3
  L2 -->|"reads, writes"| L4
  L4 --> PG

